   "subject": "Issue relating to the order documentation appears in when using @include and @describeIn",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Hi</p><p>I have encountered something that doesn&#39;t make sense to me when using @include and @describeIn.  Possibly it is my expectations that are off track.  Anyway ...</p><p>The descriptions, the usage and the arguments appear in the generated documentation in the order of the (alpahabetically sorted) source file names, not the collated order from the DESCRIPTION file as generated (with some trickery) from the @include tags.  I think this occurs because roxygen2 initially parses the files in the alphabetic source file name order.</p><p>Here is a toy example to illustrate what I mean.</p><p>File ccode.r is</p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @title A generic function and its methods (from file ccode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @description Description of gen (from cccode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @details Details of gen (from ccode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param x The formal param - x - of gen (from ccode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param ... Any other parameters a specific method of gen may need (from ccode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>setGeneric</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">def</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">...){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">standardGeneric</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)})</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><p><br></p><p>File bcode.r is</p><p><br></p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @include ccode.r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @describeIn gen Description of meth1 for gen (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @title Title of meth1 (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @description Description of meth1 (numeric signature) (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @details Details of meth1 (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param x The formal param of gen - x - for meth1 (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param bcode_param A formal param - bcode_param  - for meth1 (from bcode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br><br><br>setMethod</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">def</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>            cat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><p><br></p><p>File acode.r is</p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @include ccode.r bcode.r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @describeIn gen Description of meth2 for gen (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @title Title of meth2 (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @description Description of meth2 (character signature) (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @details Details of meth2 (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param x The formal param of gen - x - for meth2 (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#&#39; @param acode_param A formal param - acode_param - for meth2 (from acode.r)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br><br><br>setMethod</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;character&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">def</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>            cat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><p><br></p><p>Although the files are named acode.r, bcode.r and ccode.r the collation order as specified via the @include tags is reversed namely ccode.r, bcode.r, acode.r</p><p>devtools::document() falls over if these are run in a totally clean environment (because it doesn&#39;t know about the correct collate order), but if I edit the collate order into the DESCRIPTION file by hand, as follows</p><p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Collate</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;ccode.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;bcode.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;acode.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><p></p><p>devtools::document() runs happily and produces documentation.  However the order of the entries is as I descibed earlier, in the alphabetical order of the source file names.  It looks like this<br><br></p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gen</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">character</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">method </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">paramsorderexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  R </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Documentation</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Title</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> of meth2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> of meth2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">character signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> of meth1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">numeric signature</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> of gen </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> cccode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Usage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">## S4 method for signature &#39;character&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">## S4 method for signature &#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode_param</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>gen</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">...)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Arguments</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>x<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">The</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> formal param of gen </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> meth2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>acode_param<br>A formal param </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode_param </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> meth2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> acode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>x<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">The</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> formal param of gen </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> meth1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>bcode_param<br>A formal param </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode_param </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> meth1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> bcode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>x<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">The</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> formal param </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> of gen </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> ccod